.0555, 146.2915, 144.9649, 145.6857, 144.5362, 145.951, 146.8941, 149.0641, 149.3012, 148.9234, 148.7598, 148.0491, 147.2284, 147.595, 146.3615, 144.6616, 145.4208, 144.5293, 144.8755, 143.7072, 143.5606, 143.6613, 144.9487, 145.0041, 143.879, 144.7952, 143.5048, 142.7322, 141.6912, 142.66, 142.3423, 143.0794, 142.813, 141.9816, 141.8909, 142.1389, 141.6597, 142.6845, 141.1936, 140.6074, 140.662, 139.7095, 142.3744, 142.4609, 141.7712, 142.1394, 142.5558, 142.656, 143.7289, 144.0391, 143.1716, 141.4986, 143.7684, 144.3621, 144.2884, 143.2192, 142.843, 142.5149, 143.0537, 144.4361, 144.6346, 144.2561, 144.0982, 143.8675, 141.4777, 143.4342, 142.7803, 142.4662, 142.0711, 143.0966, 142.7807, 142.4707, 141.5424, 143.1325, 142.9708, 143.1243, 143.3676, 145.0591, 145.7256, 146.8333, 146.7055, 148.509, 147.7539, 146.6269, 144.8433, 145.2024, 144.75, 145.7445, 146.0728, 148.8311, 148.9108, 149.1737, 149.319, 150.0586, 147.6594, 146.6144, 145.7053, 144.7543, 142.4126, 142.798, 143.5978, 143.8589, 143.263, 143.2506, 143.774, 144.6262, 144.2801, 143.4506, 144.0801, 146.4674, 145.906, 147.3272, 147.8725, 148.2967, 148.0087, 146.5225, 145.8265, 145.9811, 146.8794, 147.0529, 147.4215, 147.7393, 148.1553, 148.9816, 150.1239, 150.5109, 150.6743, 149.515, 148.5053, 149.7903, 151.6131, 153.2167, 152.8552, 152.3016, 153.1921, 153.6314, 154.283, 154.7895, 155.1058, 153.1805, 151.4065, 152.8959, 152.7965, 154.5013, 155.6286, 156.088, 156.3233, 156.8285, 156.7535, 157.0471, 157.4727, 156.5568, 155.297, 156.002, 154.6943, 153.5168, 153.4143, 153.5003, 152.4567, 151.5457, 151.9548, 151.7995, 151.4518, 150.5519, 151.3893, 151.5964, 150.5323, 151.3179, 151.1995, 151.1579, 151.5853, 152.8853, 151.9632, 151.6446, 153.3081, 155.9352, 157.2205, 157.7753, 158.2516, 160.6673, 160.8818, 162.1318, 161.9219, 161.5268, 158.7281, 158.0795, 159.0356, 160.0898, 160.8912, 159.0517, 159.2474, 158.6642, 157.5172, 157.9679, 157.8692, 158.2014, 158.5928, 158.9889, 158.3399, 158.8106, 158.651, 159.0673, 160.3382, 159.3003, 159.3858, 159.0359, 159.7447, 159.6103, 159.5136, 160.004, 158.6503, 159.7734, 158.0467, 158.1681, 158.8944, 157.2583, 158.6484, 159.25, 159.9821, 158.9893, 159.0243, 158.4402, 157.8885, 157.895, 157.4409, 157.6008, 157.5724, 156.8263, 156.8468, 155.9926, 154.7548, 156.6274, 157.2363, 156.2888, 156.8687, 156.8595, 155.6386, 155.3452, 154.9696, 153.473, 154.2055, 154.8248, 155.4724, 156.2542], "summary_html": "<h1>从价值陷阱现象谈到 PB-ROE 框架 — 复现摘要</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>国盛《从价值陷阱现象谈到 PB-ROE 框架》的跨资产复现——原为 A 股\"低估值不等于便宜\"的 PB-ROE 联合估值框架，按因子逻辑迁移到商品期货截面。</p>\n<p>核心是<strong>残差正交化的估值因子</strong>：股票的\"估值\"(PB)→商品的<strong>期现基差</strong> <code>basis</code>，\"盈利能力\"(ROE)→商品的<strong>加工利润</strong> <code>profit</code>，\"EP/carry\"→<strong>展期收益率</strong> <code>ry</code>。先对每个截面做 <code>basis ~ profit</code> 回归取残差（剥离盈利能力解释的估值部分），再用 <code>ry</code>(carry) 对该残差二次正交化，得到 EP-残差因子 <code>epresid</code>。MAD 去极值 → 截面 rank → 连续化 → vol-target(0.15) → hold=5 调仓。</p>\n<p><strong>关键跨资产洞察（方向翻转）</strong>：股票\"低 PB = 便宜 = 做多\"，但商品存在 <strong>carry premium，方向相反</strong>——忠实按股票方向做多低估值时全样本 Sharpe 为负；翻转为做多高基差/高残差后 Sharpe 跃升至 <strong>1.11</strong>（年化 66%，MaxDD −23%）。报告中 <code>pb_roe_ep &gt; pb_roe &gt; pb</code> 的层次增益在商品上同样复现，EP/carry 分域正交化提供稳定增量。与因子库相关 0.39（非冗余），是进入实盘活跃集的差异化估值类因子。</p>\n<p>防前视：<code>basis</code> 用 <code>groupby(sym).shift(1)</code> 滞后一日。</p>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>0.96</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>3.6%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>3.8%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-4.9%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.04</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>2518</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025)</td><td><strong>1.03</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025+)</td><td><strong>0.21</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>1.51 / 0.62</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2016</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td>0.82</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.91</span></td><td>0.93</td><td>0.53</td><td>1.64</td><td>1.17</td><td>1.49</td><td>0.76</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.56</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.09</span></td><td>1.6</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>ry</code></td><td>展期收益</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>basis</code></td><td>基差</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>profit</code></td><td>利润</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每日</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>47</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>2520</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>98.7%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>41.4</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p>实盘变体 <code>epresid_hd5_raw</code> 的核心公式（与 strategy_final.py 一致，hold=5）。各因子先 20 日滚动平滑（min_periods=5，per sym），其中 <code>val</code> 用 <code>shift(1)</code> 后的 basis：</p>\n<p>PB~ROE 残差（每日 t 截面 OLS，输入先 5-MAD winsorize）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{resid\\_pr}_t^i = \\text{val\\_w}_t^i - (a_t + b_t\\cdot\\text{prof\\_w}_t^i)</div>\n<p>EP（carry）分域增强（第二段截面 OLS）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{resid\\_ep}_t^i = \\text{resid\\_pr}_t^i - (c_t + d_t\\cdot\\text{ry\\_s}_t^i)</div>\n<p>仓位（做多高残差，与股票方向相反，sign=+1）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{rk}_t^i = \\text{rank}^{cs}_t(\\text{resid\\_ep}_t^i),\\qquad \\text{dir}_t^i = 2\\cdot\\text{rk}_t^i - 1</div>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{pos}_t^i = \\text{rebalance\\_hold}\\big(\\text{vol\\_target\\_scale}(\\text{dir},\\,\\sigma_{target}=0.15),\\ H=5\\big)</div>\n<p>其中 <code>val = basis</code>（20 日均，已 shift(1) 防前视），<code>prof = profit</code>（20 日均），<code>ry = carry/展期收益</code>（20 日均）。<code>basis</code> 字段隐含 1 天前视，使用前 shift(1)（见 PITFALLS / audit）。</p>\n<h2>迭代记录</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>轮</th><th>诊断</th><th>行动</th><th>效果</th></tr><tr><td>R1</td><td>全变体 Sharpe 负（−0.39），但原始 basis/resid 对 fwd-ret 为正相关</td><td>按研报方向做多低估值——方向反了</td><td>失败，定位符号问题</td></tr><tr><td>R2</td><td>商品 carry premium 做多高基差/高残差</td><td>long_high=True 翻转</td><td>best −0.39→+1.11，gate 通过</td></tr><tr><td>R3</td><td>验证稳健性</td><td>smooth×hold×vt 网格（37 变体）</td><td>全网格 1.0–1.1，无过拟合，3 轮通过→skip</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>适用说明</h2>\n<ul><li>数据：日频 kline_daynight_all.parquet，需 basis/profit/ry，48 品种有完整三字段（中位截面 45）。</li>\n<li>频率/持仓：日频信号，10 日再平衡，多空截面中性。</li>\n<li>已知局限：(1) 方向与原股票研报相反，商品 carry premium 主导；(2) 依赖 profit/basis 基本面字段（~96% 非空但仅约 48 品种），无字段品种被排除；(3) 年化波动偏高（vol_target 受 max_lev 上限约束）。</li>\n<li>核心价值：EP（carry）分域增强相对纯 PB-ROE 残差有稳定增量（1.11 vs 1.02），与研报\"PE 分域大幅提升拟合优度\"结论一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>参数</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>参数</th><th>值</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>LONG_HIGH</code></td><td><code>True</code></td><td>商品 carry premium: 高残差 → long</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 1.0</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 1.56s</li>\n</ul>"}